        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuliŵicila cile pa cindimba ca Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ŵatumisye utenga ku cilambo cosope ca Isalaeli ni ku Yuda, soni ŵalembile yikalata yakwawula kwa Efelemu ni kwa Manase yakwaŵilanga kuti ayice ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku Yelusalemu, kukutenda cindimba ca Pasaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ja AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya pamo ni nduna syakwe ŵakamulene yakuti atendeje cindimba ca Pasaka pa mwesi waŵili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.9.9+NUM.9.10+NUM.9.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 9:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayi yaliji myiyi ligongo lyakuti Pasakajo nganajitendaga mu ndaŵi jakwe pakuti ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵajinji ŵaliji mkanaliswejesye, soni ŵandu ŵaliji mkanasongane ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye pamo ni ŵandu wosope ŵasengwile ligongo lya yiŵakamuleneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵanduwo ŵajenesye utenga ku cilambo cosope ca Isalaeli kutyocela ku Belesheba mpaka ku Dani wakwasalila ŵanduwo kuti akasongane ku Yelusalemu kukusangalalila cindimba ca Pasaka ja AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli, pakuti ŵandu ŵajinji nganatendaga nawo cindimba ca Pasakajo mwakulingana ni lilamusi lya AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mitenga ŵala ŵajile ku cilambo ca Isalaeli ni Yuda ali ajigele yikalata yakutyocela kwa mwenye ni kwa nduna syakwe acitiji kuti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, mkulupwice ku kusumulidwa kwa cilambo ni Asiliya. Sambano mwujile kwa AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Abulahamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Isaki ni Yakobo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nipo jwalakwe tawujile kwa jemanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasimŵa mpela acinangolo ŵenu ni acalongo acimjenu ŵanganakulupilila mwa AMBUJE, Mlungu jwawo. Myoyo ŵapele cilango jemanjajo mpela mumkuyiwonela ni meso genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasimŵa ŵandu ŵakumusya mitima jenu mpela muŵatendelaga acinangolo ŵenu, nambo jemanja mwapikanileje AMBUJE. Myiceje ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE jajiswejesye mpaka kalakala, nipo mwatumicileje ŵelewo kuti lutumbilo lwawo lutyoce pa jemanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga jemanja mkuwujila kwa AMBUJE, ni kuti acalongo acimjenu ŵele ŵaŵakamwile kwawula ku ukapolo tacatendela jemanjajo canasa, nipo acalongo acimjenuwo taciwujila kumangwawo. AMBUJE, Mlungu jwenu ali jwambone mtima ni jwa canasa, ngasamleka jemanja naga mkuwujila soni kwa jwalakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mitenga ŵala ŵajile ku misinda jesope ja lukosyo lwa Efelemu ni Manase mpaka kuja kwika ku Sebuloni. Nambo ŵandu ŵasekaga ni kwanyosya jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapali ŵandu ŵane ŵa lukosyo lwa Asha, Manase ni Sebuloni ŵaŵasacile mnope kuwujila ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵakamucisye ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda, nipo wosopewo ŵaliji ŵa mtima umpepe wakutenda yele yiŵalamulaga mwenye ni nduna syakwe, mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akusangalalila cindimba ca Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵayice ku Yelusalemu pa mwesi waŵili kusangalalila cindimba ca mkate wangali cakusasaŵilisya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatandite masengo, nipo ŵatyosisye malo gakupelecela mbopesi ni gakutinicisya ubani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku Yelusalemu nipo ŵajile kuyijasa ku Ciŵata ca Kidiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo pa lyuŵa lya 14 lya mwesi waŵili, ŵawuleje ŵanace ŵangondolo kuti atendele cindimba ca Pasaka. Ŵakutaga mbopesi ni Alefi ŵele nganaliswejesya ŵatesile nawo, myoyo ŵaliswejesye, nipo ŵayice ni mbopesi syakutinisya ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjaji ŵatemi m'malo mwawo m'Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO pakukuya Malamusi ga Mose mundu jwa Mlungu. Alefi ŵapelece miasi ja mbopesi jila kwa ŵakutaga mbopesi, ŵiŵajimisile miasi jila pa malo gakupelecela mbopesigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu msonganomo mwapali ŵandu ŵajinji ŵele nganaliswejesya, myoyo Alefi ŵawuleje ngondolo sya Pasaka m'malo mwa ŵandu wosope ŵaŵaliji mkanaliswejesye, ni cakulinga cakuti ajiswejesye mbopesijo pameso pa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atamose kuti ŵandu ŵajinji ŵiŵayice kutyocela ku lukosyo lwa Efelemu, Manase, Isakala ni Sebuloni nganaliswejesya acimsyene, nambope ŵalile nawo Pasakajo mwangaganicisya lilamusi lya AMBUJE. Myoyo Mwenye Hesekiya ŵapopelele jemanjajo lipopelo ali: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵalambilanga acinangolo ŵetu, ŵawo ali Mlungu jwambone, ŵakululucile ŵandu ŵele ŵakwalambila wawo ni mitima jawo jesope, atamose kuti jemanjajo nganaswejesedwa pakukuya msyungu wakuliswejecesya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵajanjile lipopelo lya Hesekiya nipo ŵakululucile ŵanduwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵaŵasongene ku Yelusalemu kula, ŵatesile cindimba ca mkate wangali cakusasaŵilisya kwa masiku msano ni gaŵili mwakusangalala, nipo lyuŵa ni lyuŵa Alefi pamo ni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵalumbaga AMBUJE mwamacili gawo gosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ŵatogolele Alefi wosope ligongo lyakuti jemanjajo ŵakamwile cenene masengo gosope gene gakwatumicila AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cisangalalo caŵili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pigamasile masiku msano ni gaŵili gele ŵandu giŵapelekaga mbopesi pakwalumba AMBUJE, Mlungu jwele juŵalambilaga acinangolo ŵawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵanduwo ŵasangalele mnope nipo ŵaganisisye soni yakuti asangalale kwa masiku gane msano ni gaŵili. Myoyo ŵasangalele mwa lukondwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya ŵapelece kwa ŵandu ŵaŵasongenewo ng'ombe sya mikambako syakwana 1,000 ni ngondolo sya mikambako 7,000 syakuti awulaje ni kulya. Nombe nasyo nduna sya mwenye syapelece ng'ombe sya mikambako syakwana 1,000 ni ngondolo sya mikambako 10,000. Pa ndaŵiji ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵajinji ŵatesile msyungu wa kuliswejesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda, ŵakutaga mbopesi, Alefi ni ŵandu ŵaŵatyocele ku Isalaeli ni acalendo ŵaŵatamaga mcilambo ca Isalaeli ni Yuda ŵaliji ŵakusangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu ŵaliji ŵa lukondwa, ligongo yindu mpela yeleyi yaliji mkaniyitendekweje kutandilila mu ndaŵi ja Mwenye Solomoni, mwanace jwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutaga mbopesi ni Alefi ŵajimi nipo ŵapopesile kwajaliwasya ŵanduwo. Mlungu ŵagapikene mapopelogo nipo ŵajanjile jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.27"
            ]
          }
        }
